Six abilities stay above 90% at every history size. Four do not. Contradiction resolution sits between 73% and 79% at every size, and knowledge update between 86% and 93%. Information extraction falls to 68.75% at 10M tokens. Multi-session reasoning, which asks for facts stated in separate conversations to be combined, falls to 28.17% at 10M. These four are the work in front of us.

